  "description": "Every single day, I wanted to punch the lights out of the bastard next door who was constantly having sex. Eventually, I couldn't take it anymore and rang his doorbell, but—\n\n\"Ahh, your tongue... so this is what Yeo-Eul likes.\"\n\nBecause of the deadline for the damn sexual column she had to write, she made a huge mistake. So, it's only right to end it as a one-night stand, but—\n\n\"Now really... just one last time. Please?\"\n\nI don't know what to do with this \"devoted man-whore\" who clings to me more persistently the more I try to shake him off.\n\n\"Un-gyeol. Something dangerous has attached itself to you.\"\n\nWith those thunderbolt-like words, something sinister latched onto him. On a day when his life—already worse than death from chronic sleep deprivation—felt unbearable,\n\n[It was hard to fall asleep because of the noise coming from your place last night.]\n\nAn exorcism talisman rolled in along with a yellow Post-it note. The deep sleep he had for the first time in five years was so sweet it felt like his tongue would melt.\n\n\"I'll treat you well, Yeo-Eul. You're my talisman, after all...\"\n\nHolding his breath as he gripped Yeo-Eul's ankle, he looked creepy and chilling.\n\n\"So please, like me a little... Only like me. Dote on me, okay?\"\n\nBy the time she realized she had gotten caught by the wrong person, it was already too late.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**   \nR19: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343003465), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14131089), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/gloomy_nextdoor), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/yeopjib_saekgi), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000079055)    \nR15: [RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/4343003466), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=14131122), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/gloomy_nextdoor15), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/yeopjib_saekgi_15), [MrBlue](